tommyds
------------------------------------------
TommyDS is a C library of array, hashtables and tries data structures, designed
for high performance and providing an easy to use interface.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libtommyds-devel-3.0-1bl1
  libtommyds3-3.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/amadvance/tommyds

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/amadvance/tommyds/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack tommyds-3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./tommyds-3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/tommyds-3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/tommyds-3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtommyds3-3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtommyds-devel-3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(tommyds)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/tommyds.README
  /usr/share/doc/tommyds/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/tommyds/HISTORY
  /usr/share/doc/tommyds/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/tommyds/README

(libtommyds3)
  /usr/bin/cygtommyds-3.dll

(libtommyds-devel)
  /usr/include/tommy.h
  /usr/include/tommyalloc.h
  /usr/include/tommyarray.h
  /usr/include/tommyarrayblk.h
  /usr/include/tommyarrayblkof.h
  /usr/include/tommyarrayof.h
  /usr/include/tommychain.h
  /usr/include/tommyhash.h
  /usr/include/tommyhashdyn.h
  /usr/include/tommyhashlin.h
  /usr/include/tommyhashtbl.h
  /usr/include/tommylist.h
  /usr/include/tommytree.h
  /usr/include/tommytrie.h
  /usr/include/tommytrieinp.h
  /usr/include/tommytypes.h
  /usr/lib/libtommyds.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/tommyds.pc

